  "title": "Sour Cream Mashed Potatoes",
  "description": "These fluffy sour cream mashed potatoes with garlic butter always turn out wonderfully rich and smooth for a delicious potato side dish for any meal.",
  "authors": [
    "Amanda Stanfield"
  ],
